Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:11.99,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)}Extreme justice is extreme injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1325,0)\pos(578,255)}Cicero, "On Moral Duties"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.57,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:41.90,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,This supplementary exam was clearly a pretext
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:46.40,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,designed to get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:51.28,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But settling things between us \Nthat way wouldn't be any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:57.99,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That is why I decided to use \NClass A's positive votes to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why Yamauchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:07.17,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Do you recall his rude behavior \Nduring the training camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:21.85,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It was payback for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.69,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:29.54,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,I'm the school's new acting chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.31,0:01:32.24,Main,Tsukishiro,0,0,0,,My name is Tsukishiro.
